OL,3,GNEWSARadiotherapy patient donates
OL,4,Askincare to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA co-founder of a charity has donated
OL,7,Fabout 100 skincare products to cancer
OL,8,Fpatients at the hospital where he
OL,9,Freceived radiotherapy treatment.
OL,11,FNiven Whatley, who established the
OL,12,Fcharity Ailsa's Aim, based in Olney,
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, was admitted to
OL,14,FNorthampton General Hospital with bowel
OL,15,Fcancer in May.
OL,17,FRadiotherapy patients can have skin
OL,18,Freactions to targeted radiation
OL,19,Ftreatment including itching, irritation
OL,20,Fand soreness.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
