OL,3,GNEWSARadiotherapy patient donates
OL,4,Askincare to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhatley said while undergoing treatment
OL,7,Fhe experienced "uncomfortable" skin
OL,8,Firritation which meant he could not
OL,9,Fforget about the therapy even at other
OL,10,Ftimes of the day.
